  isbn = {9798400719219},
  abstract = {Welcome to the ACM SIGPLAN/SIGBED Conference on Languages, Compilers, and Tools for Embedded Systems (LCTES 2025). We have the privilege of organising the 26th edition of this longstanding conference in the beautiful city -- Seoul, South Korea. This year’s conference is co-located with the premier event 46th ACM SIGPLAN Conference on Programming Language Design and Implementation (PLDI 2025), bringing together affiliated research conferences and workshops into a week-long joint meeting. The mission of LCTES is to provide a link between languages, compilers, and tools for embedded systems, bringing together scientists and engineers from these communities. LCTES offers a forum for researchers and developers from either area to come together, interact, share insights, and collaborate on developing novel solutions.}
